# Security headers untuk halaman impor publik (import.sambasku.com).
# SPA publik: frame situs lain diblokir, crawler diizinkan (noindex off),
# CSP ketat karena tidak ada script/inline style eksternal.
/*
Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://api.sambasku.com https://render.sambasku.com; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'self'
X-Frame-Options: DENY
Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin